= #text("S13. Prospective independent-history protocol")

#text("This section is an unexecuted feasibility design inherited from the research program, not additional evidence. An event fixes a common ancestor, source family, resources, tool rights, and independently authored branch changes A/B. Authors may inspect development D but neither each other's patch nor auditor-only Q/S labels. Freeze proposal caps, duplicate detection, and proposal order before qualification. Qualification is an observed isolated-branch gain against the same ancestor on Q, not a role assigned by a critic and not the annotation condition of the current stored input stratum.")

#text("The bounded feasibility plan proposes three independently sourced families and four attempted A/B histories per family: twelve attempts, not twelve guaranteed eligible pairs or a powered confirmatory sample. Each branch has at most two proposals. On twenty source-disjoint Q tasks and one predeclared seed, require each branch to exceed the ancestor by at least two successful tasks. Freeze all proposals before Q, return no Q feedback to authors, and select the first passing proposal in fixed order. At most five configurations, ancestor plus four proposals, imply at most 100 task-arm evaluations per history; these are not necessarily 100 API requests, and generation/tool costs remain additional.")

#text("An eligible pair would receive fresh reset S0/A/B/AB evaluations on twenty previously unexposed S tasks with two predeclared seeds: at most 4×20×2=160 final task-arm-seed evaluations per eligible pair. The target compares joint availability against an equal mixture of isolated branches, not a best branch picked after viewing S. Source-family/history weighting must be fixed before S. If no history qualifies, retain yield zero and the behavioral effect null; weakening the Q gate after observing AB would define a different target.")

#text("An interaction contrast is not the same target. In a teaching cell (S0,A,B,AB)=(0,1,1,1), the interaction AB-A-B+S0 is -1 but the joint-minus-mean-isolated contrast is zero. In (1,1,1,0), that primary contrast is -1. These arithmetic cells are not assigned observations. Trace availability, actual routing, actual reading, and assembled bytes separately, because installing a skill is not the same intervention as forced activation or exposing its contents to the final model.")

#text("Before any real model call, separately specify the actual model identity, allowed transmitted data, request/token/cost limits, tokenizer, reset policy, timeouts, and deployment endpoint. Rejected proposals, repairs, loading/cache, routing, assembly, retries, and final runs must be charged. Conservative baselines may fall back or defer, but completion, deployment coverage, deferral and total cost must be reported together. A policy that refuses every difficult task is not unconditionally successful. Candidate-conditioned stress cases, mixed feedback rights, or a revised candidate class require their own labels and comparisons.")

