= #text("S14. Admission decisions and falsification ledger")

#text("The current audit supports an engineering admission decision, not deployment of the highest finite score. Before treating a negative result as semantic interference, check that the response can express a valid answer, that all original alternatives are preserved, that the grader applies the declared ranking/cap, and that the comparison changes only its intended mechanism. If a same-set reordering changes a score, that is evidence about the ranked contract; it does not by itself establish loss of full evidence. If a merge actually omits a required ID under a cap, omission is a narrower observed mechanism than general semantic conflict.")

